{
  "ghi_chu": "Me can dai (Phase 12B), doi 3-4. Chep KHUNG cua trung_co_2: dat, duong, cay, nguoi, do vat, coi xay, ruong, trai chan nuoi, cong truong, trai go giu nguyen - doi 3-4 van la thanh pho go va dat. Doi 14 nha may/mo/lo lon sang Kenney City Kit Industrial (CC0, tien to ki) - CUNG model va ti_le voi me hien_dai nhung `mau` [1.55, 1.0, 0.8] nga gach thay vi [1.9, 1.85, 1.7] trang: chu du an nhin mot bang bon muc do 27/09, muc nay ra nha may gach ro nhat. Doi 10 nha pho/xuong nho sang nha mau Kenney Modular Buildings (CC0, tien to mb). Modular chi co 7 nha mau nen tach bang mau: bang mau `colormap.png` cua goi nay - do 27/09 bang cach son do tung cot - cot 15 = tuong, 1 = mai (nha) hay mai hien (thap), 7 = cua, 11 = khung cua so, 13 = vien chan. `ti_le` = min(1.53, 1.9/day, 2.33/cao) nhu me hien_dai. Retro Urban Kit da thu va LOAI 27/09: khoi lap phuong dan anh pixel 64x64, ghep len nhu chong thung hang, lech tong.",
  "ghi_chu_trang": "Tu 19/09 me nay can HAI trang atlas o co 2x: ba khung coi xay (`coi_xay_k0/k1/k2`) day tong dien tich sprite tu 84,4% len 90,2% mot trang, khong xep vua nua. Moi me phai ra cung so trang nen `hien_dai` dem mot trang rong 1x1 cho bang.",
